---
source: crates/git-reflow-cli/tests/strategies/basic.rs
expression: "commit_patch(&remote_repo, &release_commit)"
---
diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
new file mode 100644
index [COMMIT SHA]..[COMMIT SHA]
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+## [1.1.0] - [DATE]
+
+### 🚀 Features
+
+- *(README)* Add a new line
diff --git a/VERSION.txt b/VERSION.txt
index [COMMIT SHA]..[COMMIT SHA] 100644
--- a/VERSION.txt
+++ b/VERSION.txt
@@ -1 +1 @@
-1.0.0
\ No newline at end of file
+v1.1.0
\ No newline at end of file
